A||N||14||AusFiero||WOW- My luck this week is shocking even me.||||6||
Z||000000||AusFiero||07-24-2001||08:00 AM||||Well I can't believe all this.<BR>First I am recovering so fast from my surgery it is astounding me and my doctor.<BR>Then as in my <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum6/HTML/002733.html" TARGET=_blank>faith in retailers thread</A> I get some good luck on my dead video camera.<P>Then a client that has owed me a lot of money for 5 months out of the blue decides to pay the account just as I was considering court action.<P>Then today I go to a panel shop to take a photo I needed for a client. Well I get talking to the panel guys and they discover I build web sites in the convo and also discover I own an R91 Police Pack Commodore. More on that in <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum6/HTML/002725.html" TARGET=_blank>My Other Car Thread</A>. Well anyway the panel guys then decides he wants a web site and offers to turn my Commodore below into the Commodore below it. <P>Website will take me 3 days to build but will feature sections they can update themselves for news, latest projects, pic galleries etc. I think I got a GREAT deal!!! <BR>Man I am feeling happy with so much going right for me lately.<P>The body kit is a genuine HSV GTS, not a fibreglass copy. This is the kit fitted to the top of the line $90,000 HSV performance machine.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/commodore4_1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/commodoremod1.jpg"> <BR>Oh for the photo editting junkies like myself. This is the image I started with to show how my car is gunna look in its new white kit.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/commodoremod2.jpg"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||6
