Z||000005||rogergarrison||07-24-2001||07:44 PM||||and you were worried !!!!!!!! i gotta go see if they can find a tumor in my brain, I could use some of the luck   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>you cant hear what girls are thinking can ya?<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 07-24-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000006||AusFiero||07-24-2001||08:09 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rogergarrison:<BR><B>you cant hear what girls are thinking can ya?<P>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 07-24-2001).]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>LOL not quite Roger. Would I want to know ?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>But I will say I am having some really bizarre "dreams" that are if I am living another life somewhere else as well as this one. Happens every night and and is a follow on from the night before. Started a week after surgery.  I can't make sense of them fully yet but all I know is I wake up feeling really enlightened and aware of whats going on in this world in some way from them. It is really wierd but not scarey. The real bizarre bit is I do not forget any details. Have been keeping a journal to see where it leads. Example of wierd, stepping in water in the "dreams" and waking up with cold feet.<P>Ok now I sound insane but I kinda like it if this is insanity.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
